Exercise the display-only driver's large backing attachment under queue pressure.
Queue resource creation and two display queries before a 59-descriptor
attachment for a 5K framebuffer backed by 14,400 scattered 4 KiB pages.
Require successful attachment, transfer, scanout and flush, then check the
live host surface geometry through QMP screendump, not advertised modes.

